[49, "o", "\r\ncpu_scheduling: The autoscaler is asking for 8 replicas for demo/orders-worker, but only 4 are ready because the other 4 owned pods are all Pending, unscheduled, and currently Unschedulable due solely to insufficient CPU on the only candidate node.\r\n"]
