[79, "o", "\r\nunknown: The deployment is already at 4 desired and 4 ready replicas, and the ScaledObject, HPA, and Kafka sample are all in scope and consistent with a possible partition cap (4 partitions, lag threshold 100, raw lag 800, HPA desired 4, scaling_limited=false). However, I could not verify the required KEDA external metric total for the exact ScaledObject/metric because that observation is missing, so I cannot prove partition_cap from this snapshot.\r\n"]
